{"id":"gld1czyx4oy2bztcnmel0myx5","title":"用视觉化解释强化学习","originalTitle":"A visual explanation of reinforcement learning","summary":"通过一个简单的数字生物，文章展示了强化学习的过程。用户可以手动调整生物的神经网络连接，观察其如何通过不断试错学会寻找光源。经过多次尝试，生物从随机连接的初学者逐渐成长为能够快速且准确地追踪光源的专家。这个过程揭示了强化学习如何通过奖励和惩罚机制引导生物优化其神经网络。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://aatishb.com/myriad/how-brains-learn/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T13:31:06.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T15:37:25.448Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T15:37:25.448Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["新项目","GitHub"],"score":31,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"45c294e7-105a-44f8-9ab4-221cd98be275","title":"GitHub发布强化学习可视化工具展示数字生物学习过程"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"45c294e7-105a-44f8-9ab4-221cd98be275","title":"GitHub发布强化学习可视化工具展示数字生物学习过程"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fjr9i33ijtw4","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}